/T (The growing mental health crisis among adolescents in today's rapid development of the digital world involves increasing rates of anxiety, depression, low self-esteem, and self- harm. This issue is strongly tied to excessive screen time, cyberbullying, social media, digital platforms built to keep users hooked and cultural frameworks. Addressing this crisis is a major international priority under UN Sustainable development Goal 3 \(Target 3.4\), which aims to promote mental health and)
